## 5️⃣ Project Structure

### Directory Organization

```
/
├── assets/
│   ├── css/
│   │   ├── common.css          # Theme variables, shared styles
│   │   └── style.css           # Page-specific styles
│   ├── js/
│   │   ├── analytics.js        # GA4 analytics (centralized)
│   │   ├── app.js              # Main application logic
│   │   ├── config.js           # App configuration constants
│   │   ├── formatter.js        # JSON formatting utilities
│   │   ├── logo-loader.js      # Logo loading utility
│   │   ├── theme.js            # Theme management
│   │   └── version.js          # Version tracking & Sentry init
│   └── img/
│       └── og/                 # Open Graph images
├── components/
│   ├── all-tools.css           # All tools section styles (injected by footer.js)
│   ├── footer.css              # Footer component styles
│   ├── footer.js               # Footer component (injects All tools + footer)
│   ├── header.css              # Header component styles
│   └── header.js                # Header component (reusable)
├── test/
│   ├── run-all-tests.js        # Comprehensive test runner
│   ├── run-individual-tests.js # Individual test runner
│   └── ...                     # Test files
└── index.html                  # Main pages
```

### Key Rules

- ✅ **Header & Footer MUST be reused from `/components`**
- ✅ **All tools section** – The Footer component (`footer.js`) automatically injects the **All tools** section (list of tool buttons) above the footer. Including `footer.css` and `footer.js` on every new page ensures the All tools section appears; no separate step is needed.
- ✅ **Every page must NOT duplicate layout**
- ✅ **Shared logic MUST live in `/assets/js`**
- ✅ **Shared logic MUST NEVER be duplicated**
- ✅ **Do not create unnecessary Markdown documentation**

